sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR
    participant View as "Web View (admin.master.shifts.edit)"
    participant C as ShiftController
    participant S as "Shift Model"
    participant SDT as "ShiftDayTime Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Ubah data shift lalu submit
    View->>C: PUT /admin/master/shifts/{id}

    C->>C: Validasi input update
    C->>S: Cari shift berdasarkan id
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM shifts WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>S: Data shift / null

    alt Data valid
        C->>S: Update data shift
        S->>DB: UPDATE shifts SET ... WHERE id = ?

        C->>SDT: Sinkron jadwal per hari
        SDT->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE shift_day_times sesuai payload

        C-->>View: Redirect ke detail shift + flash success
        View-->>Admin: Detail shift terbarui
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan pesan gagal update
    end
